  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4df19a87-1228-4473-aff9-fcddfdf0131d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0349abca-4c2a-4ebf-8db5-c719b4680ff4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf95-5cc0-11ed-89cd-1923a6d82ecc\">고등학교 친구 둘과 괌에 4박 5일 여행중 있었던 에피소드 두번째입니다. 이 친구들과 10년째인데 이번 여행을 하면서 두가지 차이점이 있다는 걸 알았습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f1ff3ffe-29ec-4964-81d7-7ae000ee6e2d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf96-5cc0-11ed-89cd-f5322485879b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63f15ebe-050e-4a86-a650-2d5003dd39f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf97-5cc0-11ed-89cd-53ee7344b89c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cb4d4d59-ecbe-4399-9852-8e972ac9f3ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf98-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7f9b1e48c106\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-271d9cfc-4dd3-412e-887d-475a3c0c4316\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf99-5cc0-11ed-89cd-bba5b94ec838\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-36ecca7c-f233-408e-be35-79932788b9a2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9a-5cc0-11ed-89cd-1f16c2f12977\"><u><b>#EP01. 생각의 차이</b></u></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-15b4031f-0e99-4c29-8f80-09a71970e16d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9b-5cc0-11ed-89cd-f5318a34fa1c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-93a4123b-f7bd-4bf1-967c-9994052d4cea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9c-5cc0-11ed-89cd-e10cfea41ca1\">둘째날, 비키니 아일랜드라는 곳을 가기 위해 투어를 결제했습니다. 이 투어는 22만원 이었는데, 호텔에서 섬까지의 픽업비용 + 점심 + 각종 엑티비티 (제트스키, 땅콩보트, 바나나보트 등) 를 하는 비용이 포함되어 있었습니다. 도착해서 보니 운영하시는 분이 한국분이셨고, 투어하는 모든 분들도 한국분이시더라구요. 하긴 한국인 없는 곳이 없긴 했습니다. 약간 먼 제주도같은 느낌??</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b0c2f811-02f5-4746-b81f-1cd4dc9cf2fb\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-b0c2f811-02f5-4746-b81f-1cd4dc9cf2fb\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTcz/MDAxNjY3NjIwMjgxMjMx.9IeUC0sU63TiBCS3CrEnsFV8NVCxo7NHpdFcr5axqCog.EOAAiy9f-hlxQDvbjEBvyfztvAgQ9VG0Dw-mHCgzwSIg.JPEG/%EB%B9%84%ED%82%A4%EB%8B%88%EC%95%84%EC%9D%BC%EB%9E%9C%EB%93%9C.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"9248\", \"originalHeight\" : \"6936\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTcz/MDAxNjY3NjIwMjgxMjMx.9IeUC0sU63TiBCS3CrEnsFV8NVCxo7NHpdFcr5axqCog.EOAAiy9f-hlxQDvbjEBvyfztvAgQ9VG0Dw-mHCgzwSIg.JPEG/%EB%B9%84%ED%82%A4%EB%8B%88%EC%95%84%EC%9D%BC%EB%9E%9C%EB%93%9C.jpg?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b9df72ff-5f05-4d02-a56c-1de680d90310\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dfd4cf1e-9d0e-48dc-944f-bda9d166a8a1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9d-5cc0-11ed-89cd-d3e08b3908fe\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ceed1e0e-8b13-4237-9f82-58f48cf68db7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9e-5cc0-11ed-89cd-29b8df28746d\">투어에 대해 설명해주시는데 이렇게 말하시더라구요 .</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb3f6d97-1a03-4142-af57-99ef23f2adf8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bf9f-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7bb81c43291c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20ed72b9-1382-4695-a882-e63e7050adeb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa0-5cc0-11ed-89cd-87c382922215\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-08c305d1-3661-4dc0-afb4-448152694ba9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa1-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a3c3368f787b\">“오늘은 사람이 많이 없네요” </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3fd893e6-3ffc-405f-a404-e56ca9121a73\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa2-5cc0-11ed-89cd-09fac5501847\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c92b99f2-0e52-430b-bab3-944359c8ef7d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa3-5cc0-11ed-89cd-f38c7484b882\">“코로나 이후로 한창 사람많았는데 오늘은 편하네~”</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa4-5cc0-11ed-89cd-01f7bb2136a9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-40c0be44-8a73-4050-89c7-4791bd725772\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa5-5cc0-11ed-89cd-d550222e7afb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-cc5731d2-3a2b-40bf-8693-7054d14112ca\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-cc5731d2-3a2b-40bf-8693-7054d14112ca\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTE4/MDAxNjY3NjIwMzYwMTY0.HPAA4jH4ZJdCA9jr8SR6ku2BiRPOUuPhocOhLbWnS24g.UmE03racfetGkxvazL7rupQs7plDKPhU-DibJDvkU58g.JPEG/%ED%88%AC%EC%96%B4%EC%84%AC%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"3000\", \"originalHeight\" : \"2250\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTE4/MDAxNjY3NjIwMzYwMTY0.HPAA4jH4ZJdCA9jr8SR6ku2BiRPOUuPhocOhLbWnS24g.UmE03racfetGkxvazL7rupQs7plDKPhU-DibJDvkU58g.JPEG/%ED%88%AC%EC%96%B4%EC%84%AC%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84.jpg?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-35073fd7-e29d-4f64-a83a-71aaf987c5c6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3a5f218d-7ecb-468c-b867-837b214b51cd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa6-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7fd7dea29044\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-368341fe-6760-42e5-a530-cfdb821989f8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa7-5cc0-11ed-89cd-e3e2ef12ca23\">그걸 듣더니 친구 한명이 이렇게 말하더라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dad1aeb0-e5b6-484f-8042-d53a59cc16fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa8-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a9de0da542db\">“사람 없어서 좋다. 우리 보트 많이 탈수 있겠다”</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ef0123c-a2a9-43bf-9618-4dfcec721718\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfa9-5cc0-11ed-89cd-b3ed49c3637c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d28531e0-a70c-4a0f-8426-3a6196815f02\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfaa-5cc0-11ed-89cd-dff3e98ebdc3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e2781e19-8b5d-4e0f-aea3-24fd453759b3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfab-5cc0-11ed-89cd-6dcaf2446796\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eba564a4-570b-4084-9144-7fcab3c44bb5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfac-5cc0-11ed-89cd-f387407d7f2b\">이 이야기를 듣는데, 저는 머릿속에서 이런생각이 들었습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d457f03a-410d-46b6-a7b2-08de314753c1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfad-5cc0-11ed-89cd-83759d19e623\">“인당 22만원씩 받으면, 지금 16명 정도 있으니깐 하루에 352만원 정도네. 오늘이 사람 적은거라고 했으니깐 최소 352만원만 잡아도 한달에 20일만 운영한다해도 월 매출 7000이군. 여기 직원이 한 10명정도, 인당 월급 300씩 준다고 해도 3000나가는 거고, 여기 땅값 아무리 비싸도 3억 정도면 될것 같고, 다른 부대비용 나간다고 하면 한달에 최소 2-3천, 잘될때는 4-5천정도 벌겠군” </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6dd515ba-83d7-448b-9eef-a2d7866b1508\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfae-5cc0-11ed-89cd-193a1b7ab755\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8718fa67-e8d5-4752-8802-b1b4134020b7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfaf-5cc0-11ed-89cd-2582e7833cbb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a6451f8-25c3-4955-954a-d2df36f7d5d7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb0-5cc0-11ed-89cd-9552a391be9c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4f0abe07-9af3-49b0-8498-814e28d6aeff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb1-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a10daa0c8bf0\">그래서 제가 친구한테 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-276949d5-8119-4735-a7fe-1adc02d17bdd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb2-5cc0-11ed-89cd-2f6c47fb7b75\">“이런거 하면 한달에 2-3천 정도 벌겠네”라고 하니깐 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-055fcab1-3cd9-40f2-8ae4-369fb151b4b3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb3-5cc0-11ed-89cd-311be534e941\">“그새 그거 생각했어?”하더라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-189c6ca8-f646-4227-a53d-75bcd75b6795\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb4-5cc0-11ed-89cd-bb257ccf50cd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-873c44dc-4b30-46dd-8103-edc27ece447e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb5-5cc0-11ed-89cd-c31ebb32e178\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9da2795c-29ed-4e6e-b820-e2b5a8485133\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb6-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a7956ff218d4\">저는 맨날 이런 생각만 해서, 이런 생각 안 드는게 더 신기했거든요. 사실 저도 이런 생각안하고 가만히 있고 싶은데 뇌가 돌아가는걸 어떡해 ㅋㅋㅋ 이런 계산하는게 더 재밌는걸. 사실 지금 이 글을 쓰는 비행기 안에서도 비행기안에 비어있는 좌석 대충 보고 한명당 얼마고 그러면 이 비행기를 띄웠을때 항공사가 얼마벌지를 계산하고 있었어요…ㅋㅋㅋㅋ </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d7e929b2-2278-4bc8-bc06-dd0c5401c186\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb7-5cc0-11ed-89cd-b5dda5c32c62\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78fb1f00-db05-48cf-bcbe-9d71de5d3627\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb8-5cc0-11ed-89cd-dfaae959244b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1d63a185-4307-41da-b899-17bb9dc96073\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfb9-5cc0-11ed-89cd-bbe1a823ddf9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1a56bbcf-6eea-495d-a11d-aaf620bf5ba0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfba-5cc0-11ed-89cd-b5e418af3214\">적다보니 또라이 같긴 하네요;;ㅎㅎ </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c78e14d0-db42-4cfa-a296-311304f52d4a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-c78e14d0-db42-4cfa-a296-311304f52d4a\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTEw/MDAxNjY3NjIxMDk4Mzcz.97lEzukdy8m0Xnpgk9zhu5uVdAh8jaRP-nyEClT438wg.erfR8XcKwHIxRNGmOGiNmzUKvyNxlNBHQ_bkoMDethkg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1440\", \"originalHeight\" : \"811\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMTEw/MDAxNjY3NjIxMDk4Mzcz.97lEzukdy8m0Xnpgk9zhu5uVdAh8jaRP-nyEClT438wg.erfR8XcKwHIxRNGmOGiNmzUKvyNxlNBHQ_bkoMDethkg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b132feec-44f6-4fd6-99ad-1b3a447f969f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-659c4e0b-572e-4ee2-ba61-b23385ad49b1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfbb-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a968113eb4b3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6f5ad97-f2da-4ab6-b55e-a64c3b5dfc35\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfbc-5cc0-11ed-89cd-2fc99048fac1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b35477a2-0914-4042-9eb4-a37627a425cd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfbd-5cc0-11ed-89cd-c9b7beec1a54\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6728c09a-58a5-433a-aab5-b0e03c06fcc0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfbe-5cc0-11ed-89cd-ab7bd527801f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2f9f8889-31f3-4577-bddc-465e61264b44\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfbf-5cc0-11ed-89cd-311d9ca25a18\"><u><b>#EP02. 휴식의 다른 의미 </b></u></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bd48eb5f-047a-40ab-9e8b-be4924d5928a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fcf8bfc0-5cc0-11ed-89cd-596b80ebe265\"><u><b>​</b></u></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-98e24f21-dca2-4aff-b842-d6b7cecb20c3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8bfc1-5cc0-11ed-89cd-99960f73126b\">이렇게 말하면 이상하지만, 저는 노는것 쉬는것 이런걸 별로 안 좋아합니다. 제가 제일 싫어하는게 안부 묻는것, 옛날일 회상하는 것입니다. 앞으로 발전을 위해 회상하는게 아니라 “그때가 좋았지” 이런거요. 그래서 친구가 별로 없나;;ㅎㅎ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a284201f-1be8-4c1c-967f-06094e7fbe5d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8bfc2-5cc0-11ed-89cd-d573dcd46e18\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fed2c54d-d8a8-4911-af3c-cced43dbee33\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d3-5cc0-11ed-89cd-e79a8d79b3e7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-26cb67ce-ba4a-402a-8fb1-059523391c89\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d4-5cc0-11ed-89cd-31d707f0c10e\">이 친구들과 10년이나 되었지만 친구들과 여행 스타일이 정말 안맞습니다. ㅎㅎ 다행히 친구들이 저를 이해해줘서 지금까지 매년 여행을 오는 것 같은데요. (나 버리면 안댕~ㅎㅎ) 제 친구들은 여행을 오면 꼭 해야하는것, 꼭 가야하는 곳, 꼭 먹어야 하는 곳 이런거를 엄청 찾아다니는 스타일입니다.(물론 먹는게 절반이긴 하지만;;ㅎㅎ) </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa60346d-16fa-4cb9-9504-b18024be42d3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d5-5cc0-11ed-89cd-af9e45b358ea\">​</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d6-5cc0-11ed-89cd-d7e59f137a1d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-27191c6a-d65b-48fe-a560-39857003f208\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d7-5cc0-11ed-89cd-871f724272e4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d14df1db-cc29-463e-9c82-dbfa04a6a7d7\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-d14df1db-cc29-463e-9c82-dbfa04a6a7d7\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMjMy/MDAxNjY3NjIwODU1Njk3.3yLa1qH3rplHZoxDKIZm3r627C6SXxUDFvjDiX1S9Jwg.p6jRYgmoJV6rQ2teQAoWpSG1oMOjgvFIbqtOeWhVQgwg.JPEG/%EC%84%A0%EC%85%8B%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"9248\", \"originalHeight\" : \"6936\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjExMDVfMjMy/MDAxNjY3NjIwODU1Njk3.3yLa1qH3rplHZoxDKIZm3r627C6SXxUDFvjDiX1S9Jwg.p6jRYgmoJV6rQ2teQAoWpSG1oMOjgvFIbqtOeWhVQgwg.JPEG/%EC%84%A0%EC%85%8B%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84.jpg?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3ccf3946-b742-4bfd-b880-d82ec8e9f46d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4589a076-2480-4594-9eea-389d7601737c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d8-5cc0-11ed-89cd-896f35bffa78\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e86f7e6a-172c-4401-a552-4ff81efd0e85\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6d9-5cc0-11ed-89cd-577875d52260\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5614c400-6c78-4375-8d4b-00dbadb8e59c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6da-5cc0-11ed-89cd-9db3422dbebd\">반면, 저한테 휴식은 바빠서 그동안 하고 싶었던것을 하는 시간입니다. 충분한 생각을 하지 못했던 부분들을 다시한번 생각하고 정리하는 것, 구체화 하는 시간 입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-256cc03f-0912-4ba7-9912-acf525089f9f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6db-5cc0-11ed-89cd-290ba9c8488b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b40b7e0-69d4-4ba6-a3f8-7099c69fff98\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6dc-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7d0098f90dbe\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-317bb764-68a0-4864-89ee-ccf80dbfa406\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6dd-5cc0-11ed-89cd-71ac7a9bd01b\">그래서 저는 별로 밖에서 나가고 돌아다니는걸 안좋아합니다. (사실 구체화 이런건 개소리고 걷는거 싫어합니다 ㅋㅋ) 무슨이유건 많이 돌아다니는걸 안좋아하는 덕에 휴양지 여행만 다니는데요. 이번 여행에서도 투어하는 날 빼고는 거의 호텔에서만 있었던 것 같습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fcf89977-5cc0-11ed-89cd-a996ba26b5e7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6de-5cc0-11ed-89cd-e5685e47482e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fcf89979-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7bd467dc7e53\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6df-5cc0-11ed-89cd-0910f87bb6d8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fcf8997b-5cc0-11ed-89cd-b98fd3bfafca\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset\" id=\"SE-fcf8e6e0-5cc0-11ed-89cd-7192e0b8784d\">이럴거면 왜 여행을 가냐고 하는사람들이 있는데, 느낌이 달라요 ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-aa97f498-cf92-4f91-836f-ec50627b3b8b\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"im